PythonC# <p><code>stat</code> 為回報類型，<code>msg</code> 為回報內容。未設定回呼時，登入後會將回報印在主控台。</p> <pre><code>def order_callback(stat, msg):
    print(stat, msg)

api.set_order_callback(order_callback)
</code></pre> <p>未自訂回呼時，主控台會印出委託回報。下面是新單；改價、改量、刪單的 <code>act</code> 分別為 <code>改價</code>、<code>改量</code>、<code>刪單</code>。</p> <pre><code>【 委託回報 】
主動委託回報: {'回應訊息': '', '分公司代碼': '6620', '交易帳號': 'YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID', '商品代號': '0056', '商品名稱': '元大高股息', '原始委託日期': '20241114', '原始委託時間': '114047000', '原始預約單編號': '', '委託價格': '36.8', '原始委託股數': '2000', '已成交股數': '0', '已取消股數': '0', '變更後股數': '2000', 'entsta': '盤中單', '委託單編號': 'CA115', '市場別': '集中', 'ptype': '限價', 'side': 'Buy', 'apcode': '整張（仟股）', 'trdt': None, '是否可取消': None, 'entcond': 'ROD', 'act': '新單', 'trantp': None, '是否被交易所主動刪單': '否', '變更前股數': '0', '原始委託來源': '002', '委託來源名稱': '口袋證券官網'}
【 委託回報 】
</code></pre> <p>改價時 <code>委託價格</code> 為 <code>'36.9'</code>、<code>act</code> 為 <code>'改價'</code>、<code>變更前股數</code> 為 <code>'2000'</code>。改量時 <code>已取消股數</code> 為 <code>'1000'</code>、<code>變更後股數</code> 為 <code>'1000'</code>、<code>act</code> 為 <code>'改量'</code>。刪單時 <code>變更後股數</code> 為 <code>'0'</code>、<code>act</code> 為 <code>'刪單'</code>。</p> <p>若回報是 JSON，<code>order_callback</code> 的 <code>stat</code> 為 <code>OrderState.StockOrder</code>（成交為 <code>OrderState.StockDeal</code>），<code>msg</code> 為下面的內容。</p> <pre><code>static public void MyCallBackFunction(OrderState orderState, dynamic msg)
{
    Console.WriteLine("my_order_callback");
    Console.WriteLine($"OrderState.{orderState} - {msg}");
}

pocketx.SetOrderCallback((orderState, msg) =&gt; {
    Console.WriteLine($"訂單狀態變更: {orderState} - {msg}");
});
</code></pre> <pre><code>[2025-10-30 14:38:43][INF][SYSTEM] Set Order Callback Successfully!!!
</code></pre>

PythonC# <p>尚未下載時，狀態為 <code>FetchStatus.Unfetch</code>。下載完成為 <code>FetchStatus.Fetched</code>。</p> <pre><code>api = pk.Pocket()
api.login(
    api_key="YOUR_API_KEY",
    password="YOUR_PASSWORD",
    fetch_contract=False,
)
print(api.Contracts.status)

api.fetch_contracts(contract_download=True)
print(api.Contracts.status)
print(api.Contracts)
</code></pre> <p><code>fetch_contract=False</code> 時：</p> <pre><code>FetchStatus.Unfetch
</code></pre> <p>手動下載完成時：</p> <pre><code>Spend 0:00:00.598719 !!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
Contracts status: Fetched
FetchStatus.Fetched
Indexs=() Stocks=(OES, OTC, TSE) Futures=() Options=() status=&lt;FetchStatus.Fetched: 'Fetched'&gt;
</code></pre> <p>登入成功後會開始下載商品檔。</p> <pre><code>using PocketxSDK;

var pocketx = new Pocketx();
var contract = pocketx.Contracts;
Console.WriteLine(_contract);
</code></pre> <pre><code>{
    "Indexs":{},"Stocks":{"OTC":{"006201":{"security_type":"STK","code":"006201","symbol":"OTC006201","exchange":"OTC","limit_up":26.57,"limit_down":21.75,"reference":0.0,"margin_trading_balance":0,"short_selling_balance":0,"update_date":"2024/07/19","category":"00","day_trade":2,"name":"元大富櫃50","target_code":""}, .... }}
}
</code></pre>

PythonC# <pre><code>accounts = api.list_accounts()
print(accounts)
print(api.stock_account)
print(api.futopt_account)

api.set_default_account(accounts[0])
print(api.stock_account)
print(api.futopt_account)
</code></pre> <p><code>list_accounts()</code> 回傳這次登入的帳號。<code>stock_account</code> 是預設證券帳號，<code>futopt_account</code> 是預設期貨帳號。<code>set_default_account()</code> 依傳入帳號的類型，改寫對應的預設帳號。</p> <pre><code>[StockAccount(person_id='YOUR_PERSON_ID', broker_id='6620', account_id='YOUR_STOCK_ACCOUNT_ID', signed=True, username='USERNAME', nanoid='YOUR_NANOID'),
 FutureAccount(person_id='YOUR_PERSON_ID', broker_id='6620', account_id='YOUR_FUT_ACCOUNT_ID', signed=True, username='USERNAME', nanoid='YOUR_NANOID')]

StockAccount(person_id='YOUR_PERSON_ID', broker_id='6620', account_id='YOUR_STOCK_ACCOUNT_ID', signed=True, username='USERNAME', nanoid='YOUR_NANOID')

FutureAccount(person_id='YOUR_PERSON_ID', broker_id='6620', account_id='YOUR_FUT_ACCOUNT_ID', signed=True, username='USERNAME', nanoid='YOUR_NANOID')
</code></pre> <pre><code>using PocketxSDK;

var pocketx = new Pocketx();
var _accounts = pocketx.Login("YOUR_API_KEY", "YOUR_SECRET_KEY");
Console.WriteLine($"_accounts: {_accounts}");
</code></pre> <pre><code>using PocketxSDK;

var pocketx = new Pocketx();
var listAccounts = ListAccounts(pocketx);
Console.WriteLine(listAccounts);
</code></pre> <pre><code>listAccounts: [
    {"account_type":"...","person_id":"...","broker_id":"...","account_id":"...","signed":true,"username":"..."}
]
</code></pre>

PythonC# <pre><code>api.logout()
</code></pre> <pre><code>=========================================== User Logged out ===========================================
</code></pre> <pre><code>using PocketxSDK;

var pocketx = new Pocketx();
var res = _api.Logout();
Console.WriteLine(res); 
</code></pre>

PythonC# <pre><code>price (float or int): 價格
quantity (int): 委託數量。整股為張數，零股為股數
action (pk.constant.Action): {Buy: 買, Sell: 賣}
price_type (pk.constant.StockPriceType): {LMT: 限價, MKT: 市價, FLT: 平盤, LMU: 漲停, LMD: 跌停}
order_type (pk.constant.OrderType): {ROD, IOC, FOK}
order_lot (pk.constant.StockOrderLot): {Common: 整股, Fixing: 定盤, Odd: 盤後零股, IntradayOdd: 盤中零股, BlockTrade: 鉅額}
order_cond (pk.constant.StockOrderCond): 預設 Cash（現股）
daytrade_short (bool): 預設 False
account (Account): 下單帳號。未帶入時，證券單使用 api.stock_account
custom_field (str): 備註
</code></pre> <pre><code>price (float or int): 價格
quantity (int): 委託數量
action (Action): {Buy: 買, Sell: 賣}
price_type (StockPriceType): {LMT: 限價, MKT: 市價, MKP: 範圍市價}
order_type (OrderType): 委託類別 {ROD, IOC, FOK}
order_cond (StockOrderCond): {Cash:現股, MarginTrading:融資, ShortSelling:融券}(目前只支持Cash)
order_lot (StockOrderLot): {Common:整股, Fixing:定盤, Odd:盤後零股, IntradayOdd:盤中零股}
daytrade_short (DayTradeShort): 現沖 {Yes, No}
account (:obj:Account): 下單帳號  
custom_field (string): 備註
ca (binary): the ca of this order
</code></pre>
